      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not really related to this CL but is there a reason that we cannot incorporate this step into the makefile target? In general it is considered bad practice to have a build target generated outside of the build directory but I think it makes sense in this context. Alternatively, it might make sense to point vscode at the build directory if possible as this would allow multiple `compile_commands.json` to coexist and be selected by vscode.",
